# Spire Mechcycle (5/4 haste Vehicle; "Exhaust - Tap another untapped Mount or Vehicle you control: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature. Put a
# +1/+1 counter on it for each Mount and/or Vehicle you control other than this Vehicle"; crew 2). Turn 1: alone, the exhaust ability has no
# other permanent to tap (not itself) and is refused. Bot2 has its own Smuggler's Copter, which neither pays nor counts. Turn 3: Bot1 has a
# Smuggler's Copter and a Caustic Bronco; tapping the Copter makes the Mechcycle a creature with two counters (7/6), for good, and it attacks for 7
# (13). Turn 5: still a creature, and the exhaust ability is not offered again with the untapped Bronco and the Copter to pay.

